      "statement": "`usePhoneZaloCheck` is a debounced advisory check: it only probes valid normalized phones when enabled, waits 500 ms, posts to `/validate-phone`, ignores stale responses for older phone values, and maps `true`, `false`, and `null` to registered, not-registered, and unknown states.",
