      "statement": "`/api/validate-phone` deliberately never blocks quote submission: rate-limit hits, malformed input, and Zalo probe failures return HTTP 200 with `zaloRegistered: null`; wrong methods return 405 and an incorrect API key returns 401. The route rate-limits by client IP before method and authentication checks.",
