      "id": "claim_3d03f11bc7d4416cb20074add6af34fd",
      "statement": "The Zalo probe normalizes the phone, manually follows at most five HTTP redirects, rejects non-HTTP(S) redirect targets, times out after 10 seconds per attempt, classifies `zalo.me` as registered and Apple App Store hosts as not registered, and retries unknown results once before returning null.",
